# 行尾策略（结构优化第 5 批 5.2，L2）
# 仓库统一 LF：显式 eol=lf 覆盖各平台 core.autocrlf（本机为 true），
# 保证任意环境检出后工作区即 LF，Prettier --check（endOfLine: lf）稳定通过。
# 二进制资产声明为 binary，禁止行尾/编码转换。
* text=auto eol=lf

*.png binary
*.jpg binary
*.jpeg binary
*.gif binary
*.ico binary
*.webp binary
*.bmp binary
*.woff binary
*.woff2 binary
*.ttf binary
*.otf binary
*.eot binary
*.exe binary
*.dll binary
*.node binary
*.zip binary
*.7z binary
*.gz binary
*.pdf binary
*.docx binary
*.xlsx binary
*.pptx binary
